  intermissionLines:
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: 'You start closing down the store, clearing up tables and sweeping up the
      floors. '
  - speaker: Nurse Rina
    text: 'Thats a great first day at work, I''m going to head out. '
  - speaker: Nurse Rina
    text: See you tomorrow.
  - speaker: Player
    text: Thank you for being a great nurse see you tomorrow.
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: You head to bed in your own room of the tavern and complete your nightly
      routine before heading to bed.
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: at the crack of dawn you are woken up by a loud knocking on the door of
      the tavern and cries for help.
